nd Andrews anyway. fileciteturn0file0L13-L20\n\nI would **not cut Andrews yet**. His box scores are annoying, but the underlying workload says there’s still something there. Strange is the redundant piece."]}, "create_time": 1790284999.294483, "end_turn": true, "id": "f38dc5fb-ce69-4332-87dd-653ebd5726da", "metadata": {"can_save": true, "citations": [{"citation_format_type": "berry_file_search", "end_ix": 960, "metadata": {"extra": {"api_tool_source": "files/context_stuff", "authors_display": null, "cited_message_id": "5c012630-f2bf-47f3-aa0f-0b35ffc001cf", "cited_message_idx": 45, "cloud_doc_url": null, "doi": null, "effective_time": null, "journal_homepage_url": null, "journal_name": null, "library_file_id": "libfile_dc16cbae8b608191b24d0b34dc7b1de0", "line_range": [6, 7], "publication_year": null, "retrieval_file_index": 0, "retrieval_turn": 1, "run_id": null, "search_result_idx": null, "set_id": null, "source_icon_url": null, "source_label": null, "source_url": null, "spl_version": null, "title": null}, "id": "file_00000000065081fd904400604b1171c1", "name": "Pasted markdown.md", "source": "my_files", "text": "| [****](https://football.fantasysports.yahoo.com/f1/1327652/addplayer?apid=40981 \"Add Player\") | [****](https://football.fantasysports.yahoo.com/f1/1327652/addplayerwatch?mid=12\\&apid=40981\\&crumb=playerwatch\\|KpTlnfGvIr1\\&done=https%3A%2F%2Ffootball.fantasysports.yahoo.com%2Ff1%2F1327652%2Fplayers%3Fpos%3Drb%26sort%3Dpts%26sdir%3D1%26status%3Da%26eteam%3Dall%26fteam%3Dnone%26stat1%3Ds_pw_3%26jsenabled%3D1 \"Add to Watch List\") | [**Braelon Allen**](https://s.yimg.com/iu/apies/1.2/.67IWzsDJ0Ftb8peWFdObg--~C/YXBwaWQ9eXNwb3J0cztjaD0yMzM2O2NyPTE7Y3c9MTc5MjtkeD04NTY7ZHk9MDtmaT11bGNyb3A7aD0yMTU7cT0xMDA7dz0xNjU-/https://s.yimg.com/xe/i/us/sp/v/nfl_cutout/players_l/08212026/40981.1.png)      | [**Braelon Allen**](https://sports.yahoo.com/nfl/players/40981 \"Braelon Allen\")[**Player Note**](https://sports.yahoo.com/nfl/players/40981/news)**NYJ - RB**