s we need his slot to secure Emmett now.\n- If Andrews gives us another dud despite that strong usage, then next week I’m much more comfortable turning him into another RB stash.\n\nFor the bench, I’d rather have **Hockenson + Andrews + a pile of upside RBs** than Hockenson + Waller + Andrews. We already have Hockenson as the guy we’re riding. The second TE should either have genuine trade/ceiling value or vacate the slot.\n\nSo if you’re asking me **“Andrews → Emmett Johnson today, yes or no?”** my answer is: **only if Emmett looks like he’s going to get scooped. Otherwise hold Andrews one more game and reassess.**"]}, "create_time": 1790285213.131504, "end_turn": true, "id": "b6a26425-77af-4bb2-b9ef-9da60cecba5e", "metadata": {"can_save": true, "citations": [], "content_references": [{"alt": "([FantasyPros](https://www.fantasypros.com/2026/09/the-primer-week-3-edition-2026-fantasy-football/4/?utm_source=chatgpt.com))", "end_idx": 361, "error": null, "fallback_items": null, "items": [{"attribution": "FantasyPros", "attribution_segments": null, "attributions": null, "hue": null, "pub_date": 1790254540, "refs": [{"ref_index": 8, "ref_type": "news", "turn_index": 0}], "snippet": "", "supporting_websites": [], "title": "Fantasy Football Primer & Start/Sit Lineup Advice: Week 3 (2026)", "url": "https://www.fantasypros.com/2026/09/the-primer-week-3-edition-2026-fantasy-football/4/?utm_source=chatgpt.com"}], "matched_text": "citeturn879631news8", "prefix": null, "prompt_text": null, "refs": [], "safe_urls": ["https://www.fantasypros.com/2026/09/the-primer-week-3-edition-2026-fantasy-football/4/", "https://www.fantasypros.com/2026/09/the-primer-week-3-edition-2026-fantasy-football/4/?utm_source=chatgpt.com"], "start_idx": 339, "status": "done", "style": null, "type": "grouped_webpages"}, {"alt": "([Yahoo Sports](https://sports.yahoo.com/articles/kenneth-walker-iiis-heavy-workload-181620411.html?utm_source=chatgpt.com))", "end_idx": 674, "error": null, "fallback_items": 